<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">14052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>India's Prime Minister Modi has signed two energy pacts in Abu Dhabi that give New Delhi physical storage rights inside Emirati tanks.</s> <s>It's a hedge against a Hormuz closure that spot-cargo contracts can never guarantee, and it quietly reorganises who's allowed to put hydrocarbons in whose ground.</s> <s>Both sides are now targeting two hundred billion dollars in bilateral trade by twenty thirty-two.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Thirty gunmen are holding the tanker MT Eureka off Puntland and demanding ten million dollars in ransom.</s> <s>It's the second hijacking in the Gulf of Aden in ten days, and Egypt is leaning on Somalia's ambassador over eight Egyptian crew members aboard.</s> <s>The post-war scramble to keep Gulf hydrocarbons moving has revived a shipping-insurance regime that thought Somalia was a solved problem.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American intelligence assessments say Iran has restored thirty of its thirty-three missile sites along the Strait of Hormuz, and retains seventy percent of its prewar missiles.</s> <s>That directly contradicts the White House's claim that Iranian capability had been decimated last year.</s> <s>The structural threat to Gulf shipping is back to roughly its pre-war baseline, even as ceasefire diplomacy continues.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Beirut, a regional diplomat confirms the Washington framework will extend the Lebanon ceasefire while leaving Israeli strikes on the south untouched.</s> <s>Israeli ground forces have pushed north of the Litani River, and the political and security tracks have been deliberately uncoupled.</s> <s>Hezbollah is refusing talks while the bombs continue to fall.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Congressional Budget Office has scored Trump's Golden Dome missile shield at one point two trillion dollars — seven times the White House figure.</s> <s>The reason for the gap is geometric: covering Russian and Chinese arsenals could require a thousand interceptors per incoming missile.</s> <s>Anduril and General Dynamics already hold contracts, and the Pentagon's asking for seventeen and a half billion next year.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Ankara, Turkey has opened a direct customs lane on its three-hundred-eleven-kilometre frontier with Armenia, closed since nineteen ninety-three.</s> <s>It's a partial thaw — goods can move, but full border reopening still requires Yerevan to sign a formal peace with Azerbaijan.</s> <s>Three decades of post-Karabakh isolation are being quietly unwound, one trade lane at a time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>President Trump has flown to Beijing with twelve American chief executives, including Nvidia's Jensen Huang, who boarded Air Force One at Anchorage as a last-minute addition.</s> <s>Nvidia restarted H-two-hundred chip production for the Chinese market in March after Washington eased export controls.</s> <s>The CEOs are now the bargaining chips.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vladimir Putin has installed a combat general as governor of Belgorod, and replaced the Bryansk governor with another military veteran.</s> <s>Both border regions have been struck repeatedly by Ukraine, and both new appointees come through a programme routing officers into civilian leadership.</s> <s>The militarisation of Russia's frontier governorships is now formal policy.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's two largest dairy cooperatives, Amul and Mother Dairy, have raised milk prices by two rupees a litre — their first revision in a year.</s> <s>The hike follows a three point seven percent farmgate rise, and the cooperatives pass roughly four-fifths of receipts back to three point six million dairy farmers.</s> <s>Cattle feed and fuel costs, not retail demand, are what's driving the move.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The American Air Force has formally written attrition into its requirements for the drone that will replace the thirty-million-dollar MQ-nine Reaper.</s> <s>A generation of doctrine treated drones as exquisite assets to be protected; this writes off losses as the planning baseline.</s> <s>The procurement inversion favours mass producers over General Atomics and the legacy Reaper supply chain.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kevin Warsh has been confirmed as the next chair of the Federal Reserve by fifty-four to forty-five — the narrowest such vote since nineteen seventy-seven.</s> <s>A former inflation hawk, Warsh now backs rate cuts and inherits a central bank divided as inflation runs at three point eight percent, a three-year high.</s> <s>Futures markets are pricing a ninety-seven percent chance of no move at his first meeting in June.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Cairo, Prime Minister Madbuly has proposed replacing Egypt's daily bread quota with a fifty-pound cash card for millions of subsidy holders.</s> <s>Beneficiaries would be exposed to the market price swings that the quota system was designed to insulate against.</s> <s>The Egyptian Chambers of Commerce are already warning of the political cost.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A Japanese trial of the antiviral pill ensitrelvir has cut household COVID transmission from nine percent down to three when taken within seventy-two hours of exposure.</s> <s>The two-thousand-person study in the New England Journal of Medicine is the first proof an oral drug can prevent infection after contact.</s> <s>Japan approved the pill in March; an American application is now pending.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Beijing, Chinese researchers have extracted proteins from four-hundred-thousand-year-old Homo erectus teeth and matched a variant to Denisovan genomes.</s> <s>It suggests the two species interbred — evidence completely unreachable by ancient DNA, which doesn't survive that long.</s> <s>Over twenty percent of some present-day Philippine populations still carry Denisovan ancestry.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Havana, Cuban biologists warn that fifty-two vertebrate species face critical extinction risk as the conservation apparatus collapses under sanctions and currency shortage.</s> <s>A mass exodus of young scientists has left no succession for field monitoring, the biologist Isbel Díaz Torres says.</s> <s>One of the Caribbean's richest biodiversity hotspots is being held together by a thinning layer of unpaid researchers.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Islamabad, Pakistan's Federal Board of Revenue will deploy artificial intelligence in the twenty twenty-seven budget to cross-check bank, property, and customs records against tax filings.</s> <s>The board's chairman says the system is designed to minimise human interaction and detect false returns.</s> <s>The structural risk is that automated enforcement under an <sub alias="I M F">IMF</sub>-conditioned fiscal package hits salaried filers hardest, while large evaders stay in cash.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google says that seventy-five percent of its new code is now written by artificial intelligence, and developers using mandated AI tools report concrete skill atrophy.</s> <s>They can no longer reconstruct or debug their own code, multiple engineers told 404 Media.</s> <s>One warned of unsortable technical debt should AI costs ever spike.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Khartoum, a hybrid neural network and Internet-of-Things model has hit ninety-nine point seven percent accuracy detecting weeds inside sesame canopies — a crop that western agricultural benchmarks exclude.</s> <s>Sesame feeds Sahel smallholders, and standard weed-detection models fail under its dense cover.</s> <s>Scaling the system requires labelled training data from the very regions whose agronomy machine learning has so far ignored.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain's Information Commissioner has confirmed that ministers' ChatGPT logs are subject to Freedom of Information requests.</s> <s>Public bodies had been rejecting AI-related requests as vexatious; that defence is now closed.</s> <s>Every prompt a civil servant types is, in principle, a public record.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>